Note: ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note:  tools.epl — Agentic Tool Registry
Note:  All tools the AI can call to augment its intelligence
Note: ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Note: Tool 1: Web Search using DuckDuckGo Instant Answer API (Free, no key needed)
Function tool_web_search takes query
    Create encoded_query equal to string_replace(query, " ", "+")
    Create url equal to "https://api.duckduckgo.com/?q=" + encoded_query + "&format=json&no_redirect=1&no_html=1"

    Create response equal to http_get(url)
    If response.status is not equal to 200 then
        Return "Search unavailable right now."
    End

    Create data equal to json_decode(response.body)

    Note: Try to get the abstract (main summary)
    Create result equal to ""
    If data.AbstractText is not equal to Nothing and data.AbstractText is not equal to "" then
        Set result to data.AbstractText
    Otherwise If data.Answer is not equal to Nothing and data.Answer is not equal to "" then
        Set result to data.Answer
    Otherwise If data.Definition is not equal to Nothing and data.Definition is not equal to "" then
        Set result to data.Definition
    Otherwise
        Note: Fall back to related topics
        If length(data.RelatedTopics) > 0 then
            Create first_topic equal to data.RelatedTopics[0]
            If first_topic.Text is not equal to Nothing then
                Set result to first_topic.Text
            End
        End
    End

    If result is equal to "" then
        Return "No direct information found for: " + query + ". The query may be too specific or too recent."
    End
    Return result
End

Note: Tool 2: Math Calculator
Function tool_calculate takes expression
    Note: Use EPL's built-in eval for safe math
    Create result equal to eval_math(expression)
    Return "Result of " + expression + " = " + string(result)
End

Note: Tool 3: Time and Date
Function tool_get_time takes Nothing
    Create now equal to datetime_now()
    Return "Current UTC time: " + now
End

Note: Tool 4: Generate a Code Snippet
Function tool_generate_code takes request
    Note: This just returns a formatted response — the LLM already handles code generation
    Return "Code generation is handled directly by the AI. Request: " + request
End
